    "body": "Improve shared graph formula readability while keeping the active game font, drop shadow, transparent background, and placement along the graph line. Minimum and maximum labels must match the formula style. Investigate mathematical layout for fractions and powers without repeating the opaque centered box regression.\r\n\r\nThe previous typesetting overlay is being rolled back at Lexer's request. Defer the redesign. Blank must expose the shared graphs for testing before changes reach game plugins.\r\n",
